            <div xml:id="d315">

                <pb facs="0496" n="386" xml:id="pg386"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856d.6363/525: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Tobin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-04-10T16:00:00+00:19"><hi rendition="#italic">April 10,
                                1928—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 4:13 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>16. Department’s telegram No. 10, March 28, 7 p.m. Foreign Office assures me that
                    signature of bill granting concessions may soon be expected.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tobin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
